                                                    <div class="body-medium text-indent text-color-clay w-richtext">
                                                        <p>Justin supports clients where entity choices, governance, contracts, and transaction structures need to align with a defensible tax position. He joined the firm as an intern in early 2024 and began
                                                            practicing after admission to the Illinois Bar later that year. His experience spans formations, dissolutions, domestications, conversions, recapitalizations, M&amp;A, buy-outs, and tax-free
                                                            reorganizations, giving founders and finance leaders a single, reliable point of contact from structure through execution. Before law, Justin served five years as a U.S. Marine Corps infantry
                                                            Sergeant, with deployments to Cuba, Japan, Romania, and Spain. He&#39;s also conversational in American Sign Language. The preparation and follow-through that defined his service and studies
                                                            now shape his client work.</p>
