                                                <div class="team_name-wrapper">
                                                    <div class="heading-team-modal text-color-clay">Aran P. Quinn, CPA, Esq., LL.M</div>
                                                    <div class="heading-team-modal text-color-earth">Founder</div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="padding-bottom padding-small">
                                                    <div class="body-medium text-indent text-color-clay w-richtext">
                                                        <p>Aran helps entrepreneurs, closely held companies, and families make clear decisions in complex tax situations—especially when matters cross borders or blend income, estate, and transactional considerations.
                                                            Trained in both law and accounting, he brings rigor without theatrics and favors strategies that hold up in practice and under scrutiny. Before founding the firm, Aran served as a senior associate
                                                            in the manufacturing, wholesale, and distribution tax practice at a major international accounting firm. He holds a B.S. in Commerce (DePaul), a J.D. (Chicago-Kent), and an LL.M. in Taxation
                                                            (Georgetown). He is an attorney in Illinois and Nevada and a licensed CPA in Illinois. Outside of work, family time, a round of golf, and a good issue of TaxNotes are in his usual rotation.</p>
                                                        <p>‍</p>
